     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f36466e556f3",
     "text": ". That count mixes true rides with play areas, shows and MINILAND USA. Counting only rides with a vehicle or seat, our count from the official list is about 25, including the ones closed right now, plus the water park slides. For families with kids under 8, that's a lot: nearly everything on this page is open to a 42-inch child, and most of it to a 36-inch child.",
