      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9f2a38bb4b22",
     "text": " an indoor 4D dark ride where you \"throw\" fireballs at the screen with hand gestures. No minimum height; riders under 48 inches need a companion who is 14 or older and at least 48 inches tall.",
