     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "343dc73414af",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "7e59b05a9d76",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1cebc922bf3e",
     "text": "Water Park Heights (When It Reopens)",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "479d07304627",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "44c0f75c190a",
     "text": "The water park is closed for the season as of November 9, 2026. When it's open, it needs a same-day LEGOLAND theme park + water park ticket. Two slide minimums to know: ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0dc64b189c03",
     "text": "Twin Chasers, 42 inches",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "83879d737e22",
     "text": " (under 48 inches rides with someone over 48 inches) and ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2440d64f5884",
     "text": "Splash Out, 48 inches",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9d6300c43447",
     "text": ". Joker Soaker's slides need ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b569d6f8237c",
     "text": "40 inches",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e33c33875ac3",
     "text": ", and DUPLO Splash Safari is for kids 6 and under with an adult.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f672047eedd3",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "51acbc79ed1f",
     "text": "Christmas Bricktacular and Kids' New Year's Eve",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "21a807434ae0",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "003a452a0861",
     "text": "If you're going over the holidays, this is the timely part:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "8bcd41807617",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f277c7417411",
     "text": "Christmas Bricktacular",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b16c73d23fb3",
     "text": " runs on select dates: ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ed7aa2ffd10d",
     "text": "November 21, 22, 27, 28 and 29; December 5, 6, 12, 13 and 18 to 31; and January 1 to 3",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d4152ff0427b",
     "text": ". It's included with regular admission.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "093765c2cbe7",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "881eeef0bd75",
     "text": "The LEGO tree lighting",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f0f7f5e43d81",
     "text": " is November 20 at 6:00 PM, also included with admission.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e669ff8606a5",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8561a9f0d1a5",
     "text": "New for 2026:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "3a13f1f9feec",
     "text": " a holiday drone show with LEGO Santa (December 5, 12 and 19 to 30), a Light Up LEGOLAND light trail, a Reindeer Refuel activity and a holiday elf rap show.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "a9e6fb9ff6f2",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "43f8ee15bab1",
     "text": "Kids' New Year's Eve",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9a587d516bdf",
     "text": " is December 31, with an early \"midnight\" countdown and fireworks so little kids don't miss bedtime. It's included with general admission.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e2c8fd163453",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "72d44e1db0d6",
     "href": "https://www.legoland.com/florida/things-to-do/seasonal-events/holidays-at-legoland/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "718521eacba6",
     "text": "Details come from LEGOLAND's ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1b60a5ecbd57",
     "text": "Christmas Bricktacular page",
     "marks": [
      "72d44e1db0d6"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "520f38de3b2b",
     "text": ", checked November 9, 2026. LEGOLAND says it's busier around Thanksgiving and holidays, so arrive at opening on event days.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "efd633821eb5",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0bfa1ef6c6f5",
     "text": "A Simple Plan by Age",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "94ae31399d7d",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "cf8b676a154f",
     "href": "https://www.legoland.com/florida/plan-your-visit/planning-tools/opening-hours/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e61ebbf6b5ba",
     "text": "Hours first:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "55c09b24a5db",
     "text": " LEGOLAND says the theme park usually opens at ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a3bfa780554f",
     "text": "10 AM",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "01c9bd14dbba",
     "text": ", closing around 5 PM on weekdays and 6 PM on weekends. LEGOLAND says event hours are posted closer to the dates. Check the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6efe01b5df7e",
     "text": "official hours calendar",
     "marks": [
      "cf8b676a154f"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e904c35668fc",
     "text": " for your date. LEGOLAND says Tuesday to Thursday is usually less crowded.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "c96f6d460fc8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b1f65181049c",
     "text": "Under 36 inches:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "feeeda294739",
     "text": " start with LEGO NINJAGO The Ride and Lost Kingdom Adventure (30 inches) while lines are short. Then do DUPLO Valley (Train, Tractor and the splash area), The Grand Carousel and Jr. Driving School if your child is 3 to 5. Add the 34-inch rides (Coast Guard Academy, Rescue Academy, Safari Trek) if your child clears that mark. Plan a midday break; a slower day beats a meltdown.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "5daea0746898",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d5083618dced",
     "text": "36 to 41 inches:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "21be930db1fd",
     "text": " go straight to Galacticoaster at opening, since it's the newest ride. Then Merlin's Challenge, Beetle Bounce and Royal Joust. At 40 inches, add The Dragon and Unikitty's Disco Drop. Fill gaps with MINILAND USA, a walk-through of American cities built from more than 32 million LEGO bricks.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "c9cc22a1b3b8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "cce1f30f6c06",
     "text": "42 to 47 inches:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c5a911575a23",
     "text": " do Galacticoaster, then Coastersaurus and The Great LEGO Race back to back, then The Dragon. Save Driving School (ages 6 to 13) for the afternoon. Mia's Riding Adventure is still off-limits under 48 inches, so don't promise it.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9d5a582b6614",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "26c65c7c7fca",
     "text": "48 inches and up:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2765b9a1fb7b",
     "text": " everything in the theme park except possibly AQUAZONE Wave Racers is open. Ride Mia's Riding Adventure and Galacticoaster early, then repeat favorites.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
