     "href": "/deals/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6e00d34d79b6",
     "text": "On November 9, 2026, LEGOLAND's own site showed online tickets ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "09311d2abf02",
     "text": "starting from $69 per person",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4154a901ee90",
     "text": " versus ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "33e1cc177eb1",
     "text": "$129 at the front gate",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e347595a8305",
     "text": ", with SEA LIFE Florida admission included. So don't buy at the gate. Prices change by date, so compare before you book: check ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d39bb88ca7f1",
     "text": "LEGOLAND Florida ticket deals",
     "marks": [
      "1ff358644f95"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "87aae81ef7f9",
     "text": " from our partner, or see all options on our ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e7112366d655",
     "text": "Orlando ticket deals page",
     "marks": [
      "8b48b258ad02"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "3353193f145c",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "4d516134487e",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ec77f40db7c7",
     "text": "Is LEGOLAND Florida Right for Your Family?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f5f4fb9d3919",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "c975ffa6e3ba",
     "href": "/parks/"
    },
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "37fd8638ab2a",
     "href": "/parks/legoland-florida/"
    },
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "c55641afb197",
     "href": "/rides/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5f4175b5e7f1",
     "text": "LEGOLAND fits best when your kids are young and most excited about building, driving and gentle coasters. LEGOLAND itself tags rides for \"Little Builders\" (ages 3 to 5) and \"Big Builders\" (ages 6 to 13). If you have a mix of ages and a thrill-seeking older child, compare parks first with our ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7cc01556bbf2",
     "text": "Orlando park chooser",
     "marks": [
      "c975ffa6e3ba"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6a5e1d4712b2",
     "text": ", see the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "faa78a10ea58",
     "text": "LEGOLAND Florida park page",
     "marks": [
      "37fd8638ab2a"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4d05009fe986",
     "text": ", or filter every Orlando ride by your child's height in the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8075e5df8ade",
     "text": "ride finder",
     "marks": [
      "c55641afb197"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b8d32a28499b",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9f729ae09269",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "04412bc671ac",
     "href": "/blog/magic-kingdom-with-kids-rides-by-height/"
    },
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "4150e3f86bba",
     "href": "/blog/disney-vs-universal-with-kids-2026/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2ccda9a7f42f",
     "text": "Going to Disney too? Our ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8b0b485f6b24",
     "text": "Magic Kingdom with kids guide",
     "marks": [
      "04412bc671ac"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "66ff4bb7234b",
     "text": " and ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4116493dcfc8",
     "text": "Disney vs. Universal with kids",
     "marks": [
      "4150e3f86bba"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "13ca94d15882",
     "text": " use the same height-first approach.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "232c49641ac4",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "694aa775ff11",
     "text": "FAQ",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "4c7c950cfdac",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "29aa06e9008d",
     "text": "What is the height requirement at LEGOLAND Florida?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "c494a3a7b894",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "719b101f7ecc",
     "text": "There's no single park-wide rule. Several rides have no minimum height, most rides open between 30 and 42 inches, Mia's Riding Adventure needs 48 inches and AQUAZONE Wave Racers is listed at 52 inches (checked November 9, 2026).",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "998b6990ecc2",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5f246e17c92e",
     "text": "How many rides are at LEGOLAND Florida?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0d702dc26fb7",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "21bd37651df3",
     "text": "LEGOLAND says there are more than 50 rides, shows and attractions in the theme park. By our count, about 25 of those are rides with a seat or vehicle.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "16181edc75f9",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6581f6a9fa33",
     "text": "Can a 2-year-old ride anything at LEGOLAND Florida?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3e540b314b79",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "bf0f233b90e4",
     "text": "Yes. LEGO NINJAGO The Ride, The Grand Carousel and the DUPLO Train have no minimum height, but kids that small ride with an older companion. Lost Kingdom Adventure opens at 30 inches, also with a companion.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "08646cfbff69",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0fe47c764dee",
     "text": "What's the tallest height requirement at LEGOLAND Florida?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "95d5eb19f3cb",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "64604f8298fb",
     "text": "AQUAZONE Wave Racers is listed at 52 inches. Among the coasters and thrill rides, Mia's Riding Adventure is the tallest at 48 inches.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "783713e0a577",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "86159870e1a3",
     "text": "Is the LEGOLAND Florida water park open in November?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "dd98b9fcc672",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6f20a4f7cee4",
     "text": "No. As of November 9, 2026, LEGOLAND lists the water park as closed for the season. Check the hours calendar for its reopening date.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "19a6e5f78069",
   "style": "h3",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b0bc4e44a878",
     "text": "Is Christmas Bricktacular included with tickets?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "5b45dfc63800",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b8802b1a0960",
     "text": "Yes. LEGOLAND says Christmas Bricktacular is included with regular theme park admission on its select event dates.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}